#[=======================================================================[.rst:
LinearBuildParseArguments
-------------------

.. deprecated:: 3.5

This module once implemented the :command:`linearbuild_parse_arguments` command
that is now implemented natively by LinearBuild.  It is now an empty placeholder
for compatibility with projects that include it to get the command from
LinearBuild 3.4 and lower.
#]=======================================================================]
